WEBVTT

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.120
﻿It's been a long time.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:19.390
﻿I, Tatsuya Yuuki, am now the third
﻿inheritor of the Meijin Kawaguchi name.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.600
﻿I have to tell you clearly that,

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:30.070
﻿I won't continue your philosophy
﻿of building Gunpla only for victory.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:38.350
﻿I'll spread its fun and enjoyment,
﻿like the first Meijin Kawaguchi.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:53.530
﻿And like the man who taught me
﻿the wonders of Gunpla!

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.470
﻿Hello, everyone!

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:31.970
﻿I'm the image character of the Gunpla
﻿Battle Championship World Tournament.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:33.770
﻿It's me, Kirara!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:34.840
﻿Kiraran.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.940
﻿The final round will take place
﻿in one week.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.850
﻿Now, on the eve of the final battle,

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.650
﻿a huge festival is being held
﻿at the arena in Shizuoka.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:48.650
﻿People have gathered from
﻿all over the world to enjoy it!

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.490
﻿And take a look!

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.260
﻿Look at its size!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:56.960
﻿It's a life-size Gundam statue.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:02.670
﻿It was relocated from Odaiba
﻿just for this festival!

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:03.730
﻿Plus!

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:10.540
﻿A life-size Zaku statue is being
﻿shown for the first time!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.580
﻿It's the 06S commander type,

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.580
﻿as used by Mr. Char Aznable,
﻿the famous "Red Comet"!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.380
﻿They'll both be be lit up at night.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.550
﻿It'll be a brilliant and
﻿beautiful scene!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.390
﻿This is a Gunpla-building classroom.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.690
﻿You can build Gunpla that you've just bought,

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:35.400
﻿and then battle with it at
the Free Battle corner next door.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:41.110
﻿You can even play against fighters who
﻿participated in the World Tournament!

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.520
﻿Darn!

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:53.920
﻿At a special stage in the arena,

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.520
﻿various talk shows and live events
﻿will be held every day.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.030
<i>﻿I'll also be holding my own mini-concert,</i>

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:03.990
<i>﻿so please come and see me!</i>

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:04.960
<i>﻿Kiraran.</i>

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:07.600
﻿Rinny!?

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.000
﻿I see!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.540
﻿She closed our store and
﻿went to cheer for Sei.

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:12.800
﻿Rats!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.970
﻿Why didn't I realize that!?

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.510
﻿Because you're a spoiled kid.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.380
﻿Shut up!

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.380
﻿l'm coming now! Just wait, honey.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.910
﻿Rinny!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.430
﻿Nooo!

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:41.230
﻿What happened to him?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.400
﻿Anyway, there're so many people.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:49.570
﻿Everyone here is looking forward
﻿to seeing Reiji's final battle.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:53.040
﻿﻿It reminds me of the one
my darling participated in.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.610
﻿The reason Iori is so into Gunpla...

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:59.550
﻿is because he watched
﻿his father doing this.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.650
﻿That's right!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.920
﻿My darling was so cool.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.360
﻿Hey! Hey!

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.430
﻿Hey, China.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.560
﻿I want to build my own Gunpla.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.130
﻿Will you help me?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.070
﻿Sure.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.530
﻿Thanks.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.440
﻿Let's go!

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.810
﻿It's a big success, Chairman.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:29.750
﻿Tournament attendance
﻿and merchandise sales...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.750
﻿are both 140% of last year's.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.150
﻿You've created such a great
﻿Gunpla boom all on your own.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.890
﻿You're amazing, Chairman Mashita.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.460
﻿Big deal.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:47.970
﻿It's a piece of cake for me to
﻿make a success out of an event like—

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.230
﻿Wait a minute!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.670
﻿That's not the point!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.710
﻿That boy is one of the finalists!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.210
﻿And he even made Arista glow.

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.910
﻿If he wins, it'll be a real problem!

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:06.820
﻿I'll have to use him in commercials
﻿and see him over and over again.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.020
﻿I don't want that!

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.950
﻿I want him to go away!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.560
﻿Don't worry, Chairman.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.860
﻿You keep saying that.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:16.390
﻿But you never do anything!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.560
﻿Miss Baker?

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.900
﻿You can relax this time.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.140
﻿Their opponent in the final round
﻿is Meijin Kawaguchi.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.370
﻿There's no doubt they'll lose.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.010
﻿But just to make sure,

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.910
﻿I've asked for someone's help.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.450
﻿Who? Who?

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.010
﻿Come in.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:43.950
﻿Nice to meet you, Mr. Mashita.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.960
﻿I'm Nine Barthes of the Flana Institute.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:50.990
﻿Hey, Sei.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:54.000
﻿Is it okay not to tune up
﻿the Star Build Strike?

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.200
﻿There's one week until the final round.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.670
﻿I have to rest sometime.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.840
﻿By the way, this is lavish!

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:05.210
﻿The contestants can eat
﻿any food here for free.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.410
﻿But you're eating too much, Reiji.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.220
﻿There's no "too much"
﻿at a time like this!

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.950
﻿Want some, Mao?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.420
﻿I'll pass, thanks.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.590
﻿Mao, cheer up.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.120
﻿But...

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.590
﻿Misaki's gone...

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:25.630
﻿And the Gundam X Maoh is ruined.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:27.870
I...

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:31.740
﻿I've lost everything now.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.400
﻿You fool!

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.270
﻿M-Master!?

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.570
﻿Mao, what's up with you!?

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.010
﻿You're captured by negative thoughts!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.680
﻿Build and fight with an unclouded heart.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:47.250
﻿Did you already forget the innermost
﻿mystery of Gunpla Shingyo!?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:48.820
﻿Come with me!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.790
﻿I'll whip your rotten mind into shape!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.830
﻿P-Please forgive me, Master.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.930
﻿Master!

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:01.230
N﻿ow the battle is raging on!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.370
﻿I'll win this battle,

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.840
﻿and I'll claim the prize!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.510
<i>﻿I can't allow that.</i>

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.580
﻿The prize is a year's supply of Gunpla.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.380
﻿It'll go to me and my machine...

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.650
﻿the Gyan Vulcan!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:24.350
﻿Is that all you've got?

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:30.130
﻿You won't defeat the Turn X,
﻿big brother of all Gunpla!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.530
﻿This is the Moonlight Butterfly!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.940
﻿I won't let you!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.740
﻿Just let me, and let me, too!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.150
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.390
﻿Darn you!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:02.490
﻿This is the power of the
﻿ultimate Gyan I've created!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.660
﻿Oh, those guys.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:06.200
﻿Hey!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.430
﻿Iori, good luck with the final round!

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.070
﻿Thank you, Gonda.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:15.010
﻿Sei, don't misunderstand me.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.140
﻿I didn't come here to cheer for you.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:21.950
﻿I came to observe my opponents
﻿in next year's championship.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.080
﻿Sazaki... Next year, you said?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.550
﻿Aren't you too patient?

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.220
﻿A new challenger has appeared!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.260
﻿Th-That Gunpla is...!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.730
﻿The Fenice...? No!

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.640
﻿You didn't see me for a few days,

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.070
﻿because I was upgrading my partner.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:50.810
﻿The prize will go to
﻿the Italian Dandy and...

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:57.210
﻿the Gundam Fenice Rinascita!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.180
﻿N-Nobody told me this!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:04.820
﻿My opponent could be in the best 8
﻿of the World Tournament!?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.100
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.510
﻿Gyan Vulcaaan!

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:26.640
﻿Evvai.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.250
﻿He's like a little boy.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.810
﻿This is bullying.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.180
﻿Iori.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:34.420
﻿Kousaka!

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.020
﻿Are you building a new Gunpla?

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.690
﻿Not mine, but Miss Aila's.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:43.990
﻿Huh?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.430
﻿Like it says in the instructions,

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:51.700
﻿put in the polycaps first
﻿and then fit the parts together.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.370
﻿Like this?

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.740
﻿Good. You're talented.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.140
﻿Yuuki...?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.480
﻿As I thought.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.790
﻿More people have come
﻿to the festival than expected.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.920
﻿So there won't be
﻿enough particle tanks.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.390
﻿Bingo.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:17.130
﻿Are you playing detective?

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.800
﻿Caroline!? Why are you here?

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.800
﻿Why? I'm your fiancee.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:27.600
﻿Our relationship has gone forward...

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.140
﻿Oh, no!

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:33.580
﻿Don't worry.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.880
﻿I'll have my butler chase it.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.480
﻿That truck is headed for...

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.750
﻿the Plavsky particle production plant.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.960
﻿That's where the secret of
﻿the particle's creation lies!

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:10.710
﻿What, no more challengers?

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.850
﻿It's a Gerbera Tetra.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.650
﻿It's still pretty rough,
﻿but it's built with time and care.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.990
<i>﻿Thanks, Mr. Fellini.</i>

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:22.030
﻿K-Kirara!?

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.400
<i>﻿I built this Gunpla myself.</i>

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.670
<i>﻿So don't be too hard on me.</i>

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.600
﻿Y-Yes...

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.240
﻿Oh, don't.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.840
﻿Kirara...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.010
﻿But... this isn't bad.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.690
Yay!

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.440
﻿What a wonderful scene.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:13.440
﻿Everyone here enjoys Gunpla so much.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.180
﻿You're not the Meijin today?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.320
﻿That outfit makes my shoulders stiff.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.290
﻿Then you should quit.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.690
﻿You're right.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:25.290
﻿Yuuki.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.730
﻿You bowed out of
﻿the regional qualifiers because...

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:33.530
﻿you became the third
﻿Meijin Kawaguchi, right?

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.900
﻿That's right.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:39.770
﻿I'm really sorry about that.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:42.510
﻿Let me apologize.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.440
﻿I'm sorry.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.240
﻿Don't worry.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.910
﻿We can face you on the best stage ever,
﻿the final round of the World Tournament.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.720
﻿He's right.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.220
﻿We couldn't hope for anything more.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.260
﻿You two are glowing.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.590
﻿Iori, do you remember?

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:06.600
﻿The reason why I cared about you...

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:10.130
﻿I said I'd tell you that
﻿if you defeated me.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.670
﻿Yes.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:16.240
﻿The one who taught me
﻿the joys of Gunpla was...

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.680
﻿your father, Mr. Takeshi Iori.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.850
﻿My dad?

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:26.850
﻿Back then, I was set to
﻿inherit my stepfather's company.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:31.920
﻿And I was studying abroad
﻿to learn how to be a good leader.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:35.730
﻿In those days, I just followed
﻿the path decided for me.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.530
﻿Honestly, I was growing resentful.

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:42.700
﻿That was when I met him.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.300
﻿Mr. Takeshi told me that...

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:50.710
﻿Gunpla is freedom.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.180
﻿You can build it as you like.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.850
﻿You can fight with it as you like.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:59.320
﻿Just build Gunpla as you think best,

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.490
﻿and enjoy the battles
to your heart's content.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:13.200
﻿Gunpla gave me freedom and pleasure.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:16.770
﻿That's why I became a Meijin.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:21.070
﻿I wanted to help more people
﻿share that pleasure.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.540
﻿Just like your father.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.380
﻿Iori. Reiji.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:34.650
﻿Let's fight a great battle
in the final round next week.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:39.560
﻿So that people all over the world
﻿can feel the joys of Gunpla.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:42.390
﻿Yes!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.260
﻿You got it!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.560
﻿Thank you for listening to me.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.500
﻿Now I can fight my heart out.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:50.870
﻿See you in one week.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.940
﻿Even so, we're gonna win.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.910
﻿I don't intend to lose, either.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.320
﻿Let's do this, Sei.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.220
﻿Yeah.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:10.920
﻿We'll hit him with everything we've got!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.860
﻿I can hardly wait.

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.760
﻿Sei, let's battle!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.360
﻿W-Wow!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:25.640
﻿Iori and Reiji, two of the finalists
﻿in the World Tournament,

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:29.770
﻿have suddenly decided to
﻿fight each other unofficially.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.580
﻿This is truly a special match!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.710
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:42.090
<i>﻿Field 1, Space.</i>

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.400
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:57.770
﻿Sei Iori.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:58.970
﻿Reiji.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:01.140
﻿Build Gundam Mk-II!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.010
﻿Beginning Gundam!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.610
﻿Here I go!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.740
﻿Let's go!

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.060
﻿He dodged that attack!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:21.320
﻿Sei's gotten better.

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.290
﻿Of course.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:27.200
﻿Mr. Sei's been through the
﻿battlefield of the World Tournament.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.900
﻿Not bad, Sei!

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.130
﻿Then...!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.000
﻿How's this!?

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:38.510
﻿What!?

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.580
﻿Good! Good!

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:48.650
﻿Well, duh!

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:52.360
﻿My Mk-II is superior
﻿in terms of Gunpla quality!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:55.060
﻿Then we're evenly matched!

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:02.100
﻿Iori and Reiji are having fun.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:05.900
﻿I should hurry up and
﻿complete my own Gunpla!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:06.700
﻿Yeah.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.340
﻿That's our Reiji.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:11.840
﻿But...!

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:22.990
﻿I can't quit this.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.690
﻿Yeah, me neither.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:30.690
﻿- This is why...
- ﻿I can't quit Gunpla Battle!

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:33.580
﻿We investigated the factory
﻿where the truck stopped,

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.790
﻿and discovered this
﻿hidden underground passage.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.300
﻿We've come pretty far.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.300
﻿Where are we now?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.640
﻿This point is...

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:55.970
﻿Huh?

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:58.540
﻿Right under the World Tournament arena!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.640
﻿Nils, look.

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.560
Th-This is...!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:22.030
﻿Wh-What's this?

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.040
﻿It's a Plavsky particle crystal.

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.640
﻿But it's huge.

